# Testing

- Pyramid: many unit > fewer integration > sparse e2e.
- Frontend: Jest + React Testing Library (when added).
- Test names describe behavior: `should_returnX_when_Y`.
- Mock Oracle (`executeQuery`), email, and social channel sends in unit tests — no live DB or provider calls.
- No snapshot tests for dynamic clinical/scheduling data.
- Server Actions: test validation and error paths with mocked `lib/db`.
- Integration tests that hit real Oracle: separate, explicit, not in default CI unit run.
